    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this charming 3 bedroom detached country residence, set on approximately 0.89 acres (0.36 hectares) in a private and secluded countryside setting within easy reach of Carrick-on-Shannon. Originally built in the early 1900s and renovated approximately 25 years ago, this attractive property combines traditional character with bright and spacious living accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an open-plan kitchen/living room featuring a solid fuel stove with back boiler, conservatory, large utility room, guest toilet and ground floor bedroom. Upstairs, there are two spacious bedrooms, a beautifully presented family bathroom with separate bath and shower, together with a dedicated home office area.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a lovely private garden with a vegetable patch, greenhouse, a large steel shed and garden shed, providing excellent space for gardening and outdoor enjoyment. The secluded setting and attractive character of the property make it an ideal home for those seeking a peaceful countryside lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of Carrick-on-Shannon and surrounding amenities. A school bus also conveniently passes the entrance gate.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from Oil Fired Central Heating (OFCH), group water scheme, septic tank, PVC double glazed windows and block-built construction.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the character, space and setting this property has to offer and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent. OPEN VIEWING on Wednesday7/10/2026 – PLEASE CALL OUR OFFICE ON 071 964 5555 TO BOOK YOUR VIEWING SLOT."
      },
